#. module: pb_timeoff
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_timeoff/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "The person who approves this employee’s time off gets a to-do, unless the approval route already asks them."
msgstr "Orang yang menyetujui cuti karyawan ini mendapat tugas, kecuali alur persetujuan sudah memintanya."

#. module: pb_timeoff
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/pb_timeoff/models/workflow_contract.py:0
msgid "When a second approval is needed, the second approver gets a to-do, unless the approval route already asks them."
msgstr "Jika perlu persetujuan kedua, penyetuju kedua mendapat tugas, kecuali alur persetujuan sudah memintanya."

